                        "entry_id": "84393f81-53eb-3aa2-88d2-69abd99a7cf3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Meurtre d’une femme trans en raison de son genre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Transitude",
                            "Transféminisme"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "354379a4-9a11-47d8-a32f-6cf79e02b7cd",
                                "sense_id": "af65d6c0-4ad1-3b44-bc2d-d2ea010d100f",
                                "text": "Le Brésil est par ailleurs le pays où l’on compte le plus d’assassinats de femmes comme de femmes trans (486 entre 2008 et 2013 selon l’organisation non gouvernementale Transgender Europe). En 2014, la sociologue Berenice Bento a d’ailleurs proposé le terme de transféminicide pour désigner la politique généralisée et intentionnelle d’élimination de femmes trans."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a1b1e95-aa29-4e37-957a-554a62de873d",
                        "source_entry_id": "84393f81-53eb-3aa2-88d2-69abd99a7cf3",
                        "source_sense_id": "af65d6c0-4ad1-3b44-bc2d-d2ea010d100f",
                        "target_lang_word": "transfemicide",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "transfemicide",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a15b62c1-330d-3e76-8955-9fb1da70249f",
                                        "entry_id": "25eee197-a656-339f-a421-705414cb4326",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The killing of a trans woman because of her gender identity, especially when motivated by transmisogyny."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3eacbf5-b2ed-4130-8d42-479c5a08ab20",
                                                "sense_id": "a15b62c1-330d-3e76-8955-9fb1da70249f",
                                                "text": "When Monica Loera was shot to death near our North Austin home on January 22, her murder became the first of the nation's twenty-seven trans* homicides and the first of Texas's four transfemicides."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8aa630ef-7f87-47c2-b70b-42257d709c6d",
                                                "sense_id": "a15b62c1-330d-3e76-8955-9fb1da70249f",
                                                "text": "In recent years, contemporary protest movements such as NiUnaMenos (NotOne[Woman]Less) have drawn attention to the country's rising number of femicides, a category that in Argentina includes transvesticides and transfemicides."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ba6377a-8f21-47ae-90b2-5e5698dd56e4",
                                                "sense_id": "a15b62c1-330d-3e76-8955-9fb1da70249f",
                                                "text": "At the same time, it enables higher levels of sexist violence in society, with its wake of femicides, transvesticides, transfemicides and other hate crimes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1bb17f54-f2a0-43c1-aadb-317fbc2bb50d",
                        "source_entry_id": "84393f81-53eb-3aa2-88d2-69abd99a7cf3",
                        "source_sense_id": "af65d6c0-4ad1-3b44-bc2d-d2ea010d100f",
