                                        "entry_id": "f91e9377-b121-3014-ac10-756b3f20acfc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of transfemicide."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "237ba2e0-adf9-43af-8ec1-db2c5146f88b",
                                                "sense_id": "31bd3c53-df69-3d73-8c61-8ad2fe0240e3",
                                                "text": "The great number of transfeminicides (assassinations of transgender people) and assassinations of homosexual people are truly alarming."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "959b9c2a-0254-486a-a79e-17ab602d8501",
                                                "sense_id": "31bd3c53-df69-3d73-8c61-8ad2fe0240e3",
                                                "text": "Saying cuir in Mexico today is to name thousands of murdered and disappeared victims of feminicides and transfeminicides."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b35a212f-471b-4aa0-8b8d-8b19708f28f2",
                                                "sense_id": "31bd3c53-df69-3d73-8c61-8ad2fe0240e3",
                                                "text": "In January 2021, Revista étnica reported that \"2020 closed with a total of 60 direct and indirect femicides, of which 17 are considered intimate killings, 6 transfeminicides, and 26 cases that are being investigated or remain without information. […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
